        {
          "id": "996310b8-18b5-44c1-ae1b-f00574922fc5",
          "memory": "On Sunday, October 11, 2026, Maya had early Sunday scaries and had been on the couch since noon while User stayed in blanket mode, and both postponed laundry with Maya folding only three shirts and User not starting, joking the chair pile was thriving and couch always wins.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "81080304-71c5-4816-9206-d8637ee387b4",
          "memory": "On October 11, 2026, User and Maya noted fall had arrived with chilly apartments and windows open halfway, User's apartment freezing that morning, and User had only coffee so far while considering tomato soup with grilled cheese later.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "cbf1f8ed-3a9b-429b-9eb7-9bf274702804",
          "memory": "Around October 11, 2026, Maya reported her stomach had been bloated and uncomfortable after eating for a few days, suspecting dairy after cheese, ice cream, a whole-milk latte regretted for hours, and mac and cheese the prior night caused discomfort, finding oat milk much better.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c12e287b-4b5c-4a1f-ae69-76121db0f119",
          "memory": "Starting around October 11, 2026, Maya planned to go strictly dairy-free for the next few weeks, avoiding all milk, cheese, and butter not just lactose to test if it helps, and User agreed to eat dairy-free when together despite pizza and Rosa's garlic knots being their thing.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bc242923-1934-45ce-86be-5e2393f7a5c8",
          "memory": "On October 11, 2026, User said plants were still alive and happy after watering on October 10, while Maya said her miracle basil was thriving on the windowsill with more sun, and both noted their kitchens were too dark for plants.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b259dfa0-69fd-4604-9205-f869956e98c7",
          "memory": "User attends pottery on Tuesdays and on October 11, 2026 said the lopsided maybe-mug would be glazed at the next class on October 13, with Maya wishing luck and User calling it functional art.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2c899155-3993-4f35-a6cf-ace9c8200e94",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 11, 2026, Devon tried homemade pizza dough at 500 degrees, burning the bottom black in two minutes and filling the kitchen with smoke, opening windows and triggering the smoke alarm that sent his cat under the bed before she returned demanding treats, and after User's suggestion to scrape like User's mom did with toast failed, he gave up for peanut butter toast with flour everywhere.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "80607758-454e-41f7-bcb8-a4acf7fc05df",
          "memory": "On October 11, 2026, User reported 5th Street was still backed up by the bank with permanent cones and wished for Oak instead, while Devon said cutting through by the office was not better.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e027684c-afb8-4883-a7e8-4df435ab13ad",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 11, 2026, User came home to find their cat sitting on the clean laundry load as tradition, which Devon called expected with zero chill.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d34b6503-3ea0-4d2e-8928-9562f92545d4",
          "memory": "On October 11, 2026, Devon's mom asked about User and offered leftover potato salad, and User asked Devon to say hi and said they might stop by after noon on October 12, admitting no self-control with it and recalling both devoured garlic knots in the car on the drive home.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
